<title>DUBAI: Saudi's National Commercial Bank 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>Saudi's National Commercial Bank 1996 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net income		915.0	   vs     700.3</p>
<p> Operating income    5,320.3	   vs   5,077.6</p>
<p> Operating expense   4,351.2	   vs   4,370.2</p>
<p> Loan loss provision   450.6	   vs     302.8</p>
<p> Assets		 80,052.6	   vs  76,659.7</p>
<p>Full Name: National Commercial Bank (NCB).</p>
<p>Note - The Jeddah-based bank is the biggest privately-owned bank in Saudi Arabia.</p>
</text>
